          "title": "You'll want to know: головная боль",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "головная боль (golovnáya bol) — \"a headache\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "головная боль (golovnáya bol) is \"head pain\": головная, from голова, \"head\", with боль, \"pain\". Vasmer relates боль to Old English bealu, \"evil\", a link Berneker rejected."
            }
          ]
        },
